<title>India: Kashmir, Manipur and the Maoist belt: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/india/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-india-2026-11-19T22:20:49.950Z</guid>
<pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 22:20:49 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Lateef Bhat, a Lashkar-e-Taiba commander, was killed in a Kulgam encounter and his weapon was recovered, while a military vehicle plunged into the Itam River in Manipur, killing an army captain and seriously injuring three soldiers; the Manipur governor and chief minister paid tribute to the fallen personnel. The Kashmir chief minister announced faster digital reforms, a paperless cabinet and stronger cyber security, and Amit Shah declared Kashmir free of locally recruited terrorists after the killing of Lateef Bhat. India and Japan deepened defence and security ties at a 2+2 meeting, expanding cooperation. A leopard scare returned to Baramulla with twelve sheep killed and three carcasses found. 437 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/nov/19/bangladesh-violent-protest-sheikh-hasina-planned-return&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.france24.com/en/video/20261119-bangladesh-hasina-supporters-vandalise-ruling-party-office&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirAFBVV95cUxOcVhGR3JrT1AyWVl1cGxqYVlySGdlaFBZbUdqdm9lZm9yWFMxeEY0UmROc3JnbURIZGxSdnp1c3JrNWJRRF9BdGV4UzJuLWpUY001ekIwMXY1YksxZjZQQUNwLWVTUi00SEp0LWRtRUxkM2IzbUlOSWJ2S1JFc2duRDdtR2xjTHFrdTAxdFY3bDhtYURISjl2bE55ZkRBaEVvRUxISUp2U1JCTGRh?oc=5&quot;&gt;Brighter Kashmir&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitAFBVV95cUxPVlFmNV9UMDRCTUtqa0xkRTR6QlZkQnRtYUp6Z3pPenhkcDJEbTNSV2J0NlBIQnJDYU1Dc043VDlFWEM4eGRPU2llN0tJbTdDanJIVnVZSkEzWUFGRWtxWDRhS3BmTGxnc2tvWEowRXZXZU04QktYQXRYM0dKTkhuQWlnNTE0VVNucjhWaDlWS0NQQVBjbWxaQmlrOVBZNmZxNnFBaE5xcUwwR00wUklwWjBLQ2w?oc=5&quot;&gt;Brighter Kashmir&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipAFBVV95cUxPMWxSQkVqZEEwb3BI